witchery:cauldronbook.modifiers2=[next=modifiers3][h1 調料：飲用速度]每種材料可以新增一次來 疊加效果。[br][br][stack=witchery:ingredient|63 飲用加速][br][stack=witchery:ingredient|31 飲用加速][br][stack=witchery:spanishmoss 飲用加速]
